{"title":"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a certain year, July 1 was a Wednesday. In that year, July 17 was a\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/1/5710e437ee39ad7c2a3ca54fca423ea2baf68acf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\text{Thursday} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\text{Saturday} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\text{Tuesday} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\text{Friday} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\text{Wednesday}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"664\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>July 17 would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> days after July 1. \n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days in a week, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> goes into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> two times with a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means that July 17 would have been <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days after a Wednesday, which would be a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/a/dca78f03a0728b08733f74c95ab2770e50336435.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } \\text{Saturday}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"113\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2024 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed